  "source_authority": "发布文档管理 record reczz28SfbsHec2z (子物料编码 38-0001-000766, 项目号 HTE117, sku 21-0001-000339): 「【Jackery ポータブル電源 2000】说明书-JP.pdf」, read-only download stored byte-exact as JE-2000D-JP-JA.pdf. Every glyph is outlined: source/transcription.json is the line-by-line transcription the Web copy is bound to. All model facts come from this PDF; the JE-1000D JP V2 edition (same JP manual family) supplies the block-to-component idiom and the same-model JE-2000D US en edition supplies byte-identical LCD icons.",
  "operator_instruction": "Coordinator brief 2026-11-03: build the JE-2000D (print JE-2000D-SG) JP/ja Git-only Web candidate from the record's single-language PDF; candidate only, no approval. Operator decision 2026-11-03 (relayed by the coordinator): route this manual as JE-2000D, not JE-2000D-SG; keep feishu_source as recorded.",
